WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.090
Anna, what took you so long?

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.270
Our guests will be here soon!

3
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.490
Don’t worry, Marsha. I bought everything on the list.

4
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:11.230
Let me see.

5
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:31.390
You bought a bunch of bananas, a box of pancake mix, a bag of coffee … Anna, this is all wrong!

6
00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.230
What do you mean wrong?

7
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:46.610
I bought a jar of peanut butter and a loaf of bread … no, wait … two loaves of bread.

8
00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.890
Anna, these are the wrong ingredients!

9
00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:37.270
These ingredients are all on the list!

10
00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:40.610
I took this list from the counter.

11
00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:46.190
Anna, this is the shopping list for breakfast.

12
00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:54.210
I said, take the shopping list - on the refrigerator - for dinner!

13
00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.950
Marsha, there was no shopping list - on the refrigerator - for dinner!

14
00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.890
Oh no! It’s on the floor!!

15
00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:13.190
What are we going to do?

16
00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.610
When do our guests arrive?

17
00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:19.930
They arrive in 30 minutes!

18
00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:22.390
I can fix this.

19
00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:24.430
Do you trust me?

20
00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:26.610
Do I have to?

21
00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:27.970
Yes.
